  "body": "## What changed\n- Added a Move / Rotate control strip inside the viewport bottom overlay bar when Move or Rotate mode is active (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar_controls.rs`, `viewport_bar.rs`, `viewcube.rs`).\n- Added an axis selector (`X`, `Y`, `Z`), a typed distance or angle field (`Set` button or `Enter`), and a Shift-snap step parameter (`1.0 mm` default for Move through the unit lens, `90.0°` default for Rotate).\n- Added Shift snapping to `move_drag` and `turn_drag`, keeping raw unsnapped drag state so pressing or releasing Shift mid-drag updates the preview cleanly and live drags mirror into the bar.\n- Updated `viewport_layout`, `move_handles`, `turn_handles`, and `shell.rs` so the legend, empty-document prompt, and drag readout clear the expanded bar and clicks on bar widgets never orbit or pick.\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/1198-bar-snap-and-value.md`.\n\n## Cause\nSlices (a) through (c) of #1198 shipped the bottom bar, move handles, and rotate rings (PRs #1203, #1330, #2185). Slice (d) remained open for snapping parameters with a modifier key and typed distance or angle entry in the bar.\n\n## Tests\n- **Pinning tests** (5 failed red before the fix; all pass green after):\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_drag::shift_drag_snaps_to_the_bar_step_and_updates_the_value`\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_drag::typing_a_distance_in_the_bar_moves_by_that_exact_amount_as_one_undo_step`\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_drag::bad_or_zero_distance_in_the_bar_adds_no_history_step`\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_turn::shift_drag_snaps_to_the_bar_angle_step`\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_turn::typing_an_angle_in_the_bar_turns_the_part_about_the_chosen_axis_as_one_undo_step`\n- **Additional unit & UI tests added** (all pass):\n  - `egui_app::tests::body_turn::changing_snap_step_in_the_bar_changes_shift_drag_snap`\n  - `move_drag_tests::shift_snap_rounds_drag_and_toggling_shift_updates_preview`\n  - `turn_drag_tests::shift_snap_rounds_angle_and_keeps_unwrapped_raw_angle`\n  - `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::expanded_bar_contains_controls_without_touching_buttons`\n  - `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::typed_move_and_turn_respect_units_and_refuse_bad_input`\n  - `egui_app::viewport_layout::tests::legend_clears_the_expanded_ribbon`\n- **Mutation checks** (each failed red when reverted/bypassed, passed green when restored):\n  - Move Shift-snap guard (`move_drag::motion_snapped` / `resnap` bypassed) -> red/green on `shift_drag_snaps_to_the_bar_step_and_updates_the_value`\n  - Rotate Shift-snap guard (`turn_drag::motion_snapped` / `resnap` bypassed) -> red/green on `shift_drag_snaps_to_the_bar_angle_step`\n  - Bar controls draw (`shell.rs` `controls::draw` omitted) -> red/green on `in_the_bar` tests\n  - Unit-lens and zero-move guard (`viewport_bar_controls::apply_move_text` bypassed) -> red/green on `typed_move_and_turn_respect_units_and_refuse_bad_input`\n- **Gate & clippy** (run after final edit):\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 17/17 steps passed (`camcraft-ui` lib 1227 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored release-lane snapshots; 15 integration suites passed).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: 0 warnings, 0 errors.\n\n## Goldens moved\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n- Release-lane pixel snapshot tests (`#[ignore]`d, regenerated only at release cuts) and interactive desktop GPU window testing.\n\n## Overlaps\n- PR #2644 touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` in the simulation transport block (`state.sim`), a different function section; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- PR #2563 touches `crates/ui/src/state.rs` (linked-model import watch), different fields and commands; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- PR #2149 touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` (`avoid_viz`) and `crates/ui/src/state.rs`, different sections; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- PR #1798 touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` (`shell_layout` windows) and `crates/ui/src/state.rs`, different sections; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: high\nChangelog: Added Shift snapping with editable step parameters and typed move/rotate distance and angle entry to the viewport bottom bar.\nFixes #1198\n",
